      "excerpt": "> [!NOTE] > **Real user, single day (2026-05-01):** 435M input tokens, **99.82% cache hit**, ~$12 instead of the ~$61 the same workload would cost with no cache on `v4-flash` — see the [case study](./benchmarks/real-world-cache/README.md). DeepSeek provides the cacheable bytes; the four mechanisms in [Pillar 1](./docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#pillar-1--cache-first-loop) are how Reasonix keeps them cacheable across long sessions.",
